# Per-machine device state. These record which emulator you last ran on and how
# you sorted the device list, so they churn on every machine and show up in the
# commit dialog forever. deploymentTargetSelector.xml was still carrying one
# teammate's macOS avd path.
#
# The rest of Vinyl/.idea/ stays tracked on purpose: codeStyles, inspection
# profiles, run configurations and misc.xml are shared project settings.
